formance Marketing &amp; ABM</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#services\">Corporate PR &amp; Brand Authority</a></nav></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white\">Company</h3><nav class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3\"><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#about\">About</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#insights\">Insights</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#\">Careers<span class=\"rounded-full border border-ssl-gold/20 bg-ssl-gold/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-ssl-gold\">Hiring</span></a></nav></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white\">Legal</h3><nav class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3\"><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#\">Terms of Service</a><a class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-[#c5a059]\" href=\"#\">Cookie Policy</a></nav></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 border-t border-white/[0.06] pt-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500/80 sm:flex-row\"><p>© 2022–2026 Signal Strait Labs. All rights reserved.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-3 w-3 text-[#c5a059]/60\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span>Nairobi, Kenya</span></div></div></div></div></footer></div><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3s6nzrbk-8mnv.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><main class=\"bg-ssl-light-bg min-h-screen py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"mb-12 flex flex-col items-center text-center\"><div class=\"mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-ssl-blue/10 text-ssl-blue\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-no-axes-column-increasing lucide-bar-chart h-8 w-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 21v-6\"></path><path d=\"M12 21V9\"></path><path d=\"M19 21V3\"></path></svg></div><h1 class=\"mb-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ssl-bg md:text-5xl\">Data Systems &amp; Automation</h1><p class=\"text-lg text-slate-600\">We design robust data architectures, custom robust API frameworks, and advanced low-code/no-code automated pipelines that link siloed internal software tools, completely eliminating manual data overhead.</p></div></div><div class=\"space-y-16\"><div style=\"animation-delay:0s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">The Problem</h2><div class=\"glass-card-light rounded-xl p-8\"><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Growing companies often run on tools that don&#x27;t talk to each other. Someone ends up copying data by hand between systems, and mistakes creep in.</p></div></section></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.1s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Our Approach</h2><div class=\"glass-card-light rounded-xl p-8\"><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">We connect your tools with automated workflows, so data moves between systems on its own. If two platforms can share information, we make sure they do.</p></div></section></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.2s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><section><h2 class=\"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">The Outcome</h2><div class=\"glass-card-light rounded-xl p-8\"><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Less manual work, fewer errors, and a clear, live view of what&#x27;s happening across your business.</p></div></section></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.3s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><section><h2 class=\"mb-8 text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg text-center\">Common Questions</h2><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"glass-card-light overflow-hidden rounded-xl border\"><button class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between p-6 text-left\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ssl-bg\">What if our tools weren&#x27;t built to connect with each other?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Most tools have an API or support a connector platform like Zapier or Make. We find the best route to connect them, even when it&#x27;s not obvious.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"glass-card-light overflow-hidden rounded-xl border\"><button class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between p-6 text-left\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ssl-bg\">Will this replace our current software?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">No. We connect what you already use so it works together. We only recommend replacing a tool if it&#x27;s genuinely holding you back.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"glass-card-light overflow-hidden rounded-xl border\"><button class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between p-6 text-left\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-ssl-bg\">How much manual work can actually be automated?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 text-ssl-blue transition-transform duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div class=\"grid transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden\"><p class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">It depends on your setup, but most businesses we work with cut a significant amount of repetitive data entry within the first month.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 mt-20\"><section><h2 class=\"mb-8 text-center text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\">Related Services</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><a href=\"/services/technical-infrastructure-web-dev\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-ssl-gold/15 bg-ssl-bg transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ssl-gold/5 hover:scale-[1.015] hover:-translate-y-0.5 overflow-hidden flex h-full flex-col p-6 hover:border-ssl-blue/40\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white\">Technical Infrastructure &amp; Web Dev</h3></div></a><a href=\"/services/algorithmic-search\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-ssl-gold/15 bg-ssl-bg transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ssl-gold/5 hover:scale-[1.015] hover:-translate-y-0.5 overflow-hidden flex h-full flex-col p-6 hover:border-ssl-blue/40\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white\">Algorithmic Search (SEO/AEO/GEO)</h3></div></a><a href=\"/services/revenue-operations-revops\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-ssl-gold/15 bg-ssl-bg transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ssl-gold/5 hover:scale-[1.015] hover:-translate-y-0.5 overflow-hidden flex h-full flex-col p-6 hover:border-ssl-blue/40\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-white\">Revenue Operations (RevOps)</h3></div></a></div></section></div><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 mt-20 text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-slate-950 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 dark:focus-visible:ring-slate-300 text-[#01081b] font-medium transition-colors h-11 px-8 text-base bg-ssl-blue hover:bg-ssl-blue/90\" href=\"/#contact\">Start a Project</a></div></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script>$RB=[];$RV=function(a){$RT=performance.now();for(var b=0;b<a.length;b+=2){var c=a[b],e=a[b+1];null!==e.parentNod