pletely eliminating manual data overhead.\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-16\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"$L20\",\"The Problem\",{\"variant\":\"slide-up\",\"style\":{\"animationDelay\":\"0s\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\",\"children\":\"The Problem\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"glass-card-light rounded-xl p-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Growing companies often run on tools that don't talk to each other. Someone ends up copying data by hand between systems, and mistakes creep in.\"}]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",\"Our Approach\",{\"variant\":\"slide-up\",\"style\":{\"animationDelay\":\"0.1s\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\",\"children\":\"Our Approach\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"glass-card-light rounded-xl p-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"We connect your tools with automated workflows, so data moves between systems on its own. If two platforms can share information, we make sure they do.\"}]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",\"The Outcome\",{\"variant\":\"slide-up\",\"style\":{\"animationDelay\":\"0.2s\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\",\"children\":\"The Outcome\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"glass-card-light rounded-xl p-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Less manual work, fewer errors, and a clear, live view of what's happening across your business.\"}]}]]}]}]],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"variant\":\"slide-up\",\"style\":{\"animationDelay\":\"0.3s\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8 text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg text-center\",\"children\":\"Common Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"$L22\",null,{\"items\":[{\"question\":\"What if our tools weren't built to connect with each other?\",\"answer\":\"Most tools have an API or support a connector platform like Zapier or Make. We find the best route to connect them, even when it's not obvious.\"},{\"question\":\"Will this replace our current software?\",\"answer\":\"No. We connect what you already use so it works together. We only recommend replacing a tool if it's genuinely holding you back.\"},{\"question\":\"How much manual work can actually be automated?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on your setup, but most businesses we work with cut a significant amount of repetitive data entry within the first month.\"}]}]]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"variant\":\"slide-up\",\"className\":\"mt-20\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8 text-center text-2xl font-bold text-ssl-bg\",\"children\":\"Related Services\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"technical-infrastructure-web-dev\",{\"href\":\"/services/technical-infrastructure-web-dev\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-ssl-gold/15 bg-ssl-bg transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ssl-gold/5 hover:scale-[1.015] hover:-translate-y-0.5 overflow-hidden flex h-full flex-col p-6 hover:border-ssl-blue/40\",\"children\":\"$L23\"}]}],\"$L24\",\"$L25\"]}]]}]}],\"$L26\"]}]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"Technical Infrastructure & Web Dev\"}]\n24:[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"algorithmic-search\",{\"href\":\"/services/algorithmic-search\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-ssl-gold/15 bg-ssl-bg transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ssl-gold/5 hover:s